WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.070
Spurn is a spit in East Yorkshire.

2
00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:05.870
It reaches out from
the coast into the sea.

3
00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:10.670
In December 2013, the sea
broke right through it.

4
00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:15.050
Coastal flooding: the sea covers
land that is normally dry.

5
00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:19.950
So what can push the sea far enough
inland to flood a whole coastline?

6
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.310
In this mission, you'll meet
three causes of coastal flooding,

7
00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:27.050
and find out why floods
are worst at high tide.

8
00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:30.190
Then you'll work out which
conditions push the water highest,

9
00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:33.570
and how fast each cause can strike.

10
00:00:33.620 --> 00:00:36.690
Your mission: find out what
can push the sea inland,

11
00:00:36.740 --> 00:00:39.080
and how to tell the causes apart.
